# Secrets
.env

# Corpus — resume.pdf and about_me.md are now committed so Render can
# build without hitting ARG_MAX when base64-encoded as env vars (558KB+).
# These files are already public information (LinkedIn / professional copy).
corpus/github/
corpus/resume_b64.txt
corpus/about_me_b64.txt

# FAISS index (built from corpus at runtime)
corpus/faiss_index/
*.faiss
*.pkl

